{"root":"embus","ipa":"/emˈbus/","core":"气喘吁吁，喘息","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/emˈbus/","zh":"指因劳累、生病或急促运动而大口喘气、呼吸急促的状态。","phrases":[{"t":"embus napas","zh":"喘息"},{"t":"mulai embus","zh":"开始喘粗气"},{"t":"terengah-embus","zh":"气喘吁吁"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia lari begitu cepat sampai embus-embusan.","zh":"他跑得那么快，以至于气喘吁吁。"},{"t":"Kakek duduk di kursi sambil embus menahan lelah.","zh":"爷爷坐在椅子上，喘着粗气忍受着疲劳。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"embus","ipa":"/emˈbus/","zh":"气喘，呼气","phrase":{"t":"embus angin","zh":"微风吹拂"},"example":{"t":"Angin sepoi-sepoi embus di wajahnya.","zh":"微风吹拂着他的脸庞。"}},{"w":"mengembus","ipa":"/məŋˈbus/","zh":"吹，吹气，呼出","phrase":{"t":"mengembus debu","zh":"吹掉灰尘"},"example":{"t":"Dia mengembus debu di atas meja.","zh":"他吹掉了桌子上的灰尘。"}},{"w":"mengembuskan","ipa":"/məŋˈbus.kan/","zh":"吹出，呼出（气）","phrase":{"t":"mengembuskan napas","zh":"呼出一口气"},"example":{"t":"Dia mengembuskan napas panjang karena lega.","zh":"他松了一口气，长长地呼出了一口气。"}},{"w":"terembus","ipa":"/tərˈem.bus/","zh":"被吹动，被呼出","phrase":{"t":"terembus angin","zh":"被风吹到"},"example":{"t":"Bau harum terembus angin ke luar.","zh":"香味被风吹到了外面。"}},{"w":"hembusan","ipa":"/həmˈbu.san/","zh":"一阵风，吹拂，呼气","phrase":{"t":"hembusan angin","zh":"一阵阵的风"},"example":{"t":"Hembusan angin malam sangat dingin.","zh":"夜晚的风吹得很冷。"}}],"derSlugs":["embus","mengembus","mengembuskan","terembus","hembusan"],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:48:53.493Z","src":"base"}